# Product Taste Skill

When the user asks "should we build", "is this worth building", "taste check", "what would you cut", "prioritize these", or "product review":

1. Read `skills/product-taste/SKILL.md`
2. Identify what's being evaluated (feature, idea, product decision)
3. Run the 5-filter evaluation in order — stop at the first filter that kills it
4. Deliver verdict: BUILD / DEFER / KILL with reasoning
5. Default stance is skepticism — the feature has to survive all five filters to earn BUILD
